WEBVTT

00:00:26.908 --> 00:00:30.810
They were not enthusiastic
about my patriotism.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.904
This is my picture with my brother.

00:00:32.904 --> 00:00:35.739
This is me, the little one,
and I know what you're thinking:

00:00:35.739 --> 00:00:38.680
"You used to look cute,
what the heck happened to you?"

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.631
But my brother, who is older than me,

00:00:40.631 --> 00:00:43.045
was arrested when he was 18,

00:00:43.045 --> 00:00:45.994
taken to prison on charges
of throwing stones.

00:00:45.994 --> 00:00:49.570
He was beaten up when he refused
to confess that he threw stones,

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:52.171
and as a result, had internal injuries

00:00:52.171 --> 00:00:56.814
that caused his death soon after
he was released from prison.

00:00:56.814 --> 00:01:00.460
I was angry, I was bitter,